## Modifications for GBC Project

This enhanced version includes modifications specifically designed for the 
GBC (Generalized Behavior-Cloning Framework for Whole-Body Humanoid Imitation) project:

- RSL RL MM Series Interface for multi-modal imitation learning
- Enhanced environment interface with reference observation support
- Student-teacher transformer architectures
- Multi-modal PPO implementation
- Distillation algorithms for knowledge transfer

All modifications are licensed under the same BSD-3-Clause license terms.
